flowchart TB
    U[User / Host Application] --> C[Conversational Agent]
    C --> R[Reasoning Agent]
    R -->|Untrusted action proposal| I[CAAIF Interaction Controller]
    U -->|Authenticated trusted intent| I
    I --> P[Independent policy & provenance checks]
    P -->|Action-bound permit| T[Task Agent]
    T -->|Request + permit| G[Independent Tool Gateway]
    G -->|Live introspection| I
    G -->|Current version + granted projection| X[(Independent Context Provider)]
    R -->|Authorized context read| X
    I -->|Current context verification| X
    G -->|Authorized effect| SYS[Registered Tool / External System]
    SYS --> T
    T --> R
    R -->|Disclosure must be checked| C
    classDef trusted fill:#eaf3fa,stroke:#35637e
    class I,P,G,X trusted
